# Ignore everything
*

# But not these directories and workspace packages
!docs/
!docs/**
!releases/
!releases/**
!schema/
!schema/**
!packages/
!packages/**

# And not these essential root files
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-DOCS
!SECURITY.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!package.json

# Still ignore common build/dependency artifacts and OS noise within tracked dirs
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
dist/
**/dist/
**/dist/**
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Process tools & internal governance MUST NEVER enter Git (GOV-05)
openspec/
.kiro/
.dev-os/
.cursor/
.githooks/
decisions/
AGENTS.md
